  (text "EC MODULE-DETECTION + PULL-UPS (values from forum reports - UNVERIFIED, check against Framework reference design)" (at 39.37 448.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "107b9d42-9904-4917-8a94-b72b3ee0faff"))
(text "PWR_LEVEL: battery -> reduced card power (GPIO2_EC = AC present)" (at 340.36 502.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "b716f07c-1d60-4a19-80a4-a92915b78869"))
(text "EEPROM: blank = EC defaults to dual-SSD (x4x2) and never enables VSYS. Program PCIE_THERMAL_3RDPARTY (PCIE_8X1, VSYS_EN, FAN_EN, 3V_5V_EN, F75303 @0x4D)," (at 39.37 490.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "297d1177-d414-4e40-a38b-b107c2b6b7db"))
(text "but set GPU_PCIE_MUX_SEL LOW so DP_A AUX is not rerouted to SSD2 CLK. Note: EC sets GPU_PRESENT (eDP mux path) only for vendor GPU_AMD_R23M." (at 39.37 494.03 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "a36298d1-50f6-4fb1-a907-25a1b4c1ca51"))
(text "POWER: VSYS -> TVS D1 -> eFuse U1 (TPS25982, ~9.9 A limit) -> PWR_SRC to the MXM card; +5V / +3V3 from host 5V_ALW (2.5A max) / 3V3_ALW (2.0A max)" (at 39.37 519.43 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "19c6263c-db4a-4c43-a51e-7fc041869556"))
(text "J2 POWER INTERPOSER (pinout: FrameworkComputer/ExpansionBay)" (at 439.42 66.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "a67ed8cf-c743-4e38-afe1-dff61a7b429d"))
(text "PWR_EN: 1.8 V host GPIO AND eFuse PG -> 3.3 V card PWR_EN" (at 304.8 595.63 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "957911e8-fc05-44e1-acc7-9c581b1bed20"))
(text "FAN HEADERS - host EC drives 12V_FAN / PWM (5 V) and reads SPEED (5 V OD). Pinout per FW ref PCB drawing." (at 560.07 66.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "92a606be-0ad1-465d-bc44-565b7a7337d4"))
(text "FAN-CONTROL TEMP SENSOR - F75303 @0x4D on the ALW I2C bus (Framework PCIE_THERMAL_3RDPARTY descriptor). Pins per LCFC NM-D471 sheet 77." (at 420.37 448.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "3dff822d-53a8-4ddb-9edc-c3cca749fd02"))
(text "FW16 EXPANSION BAY -> MXM 3.x ADAPTER  |  schematic v4 DRAFT  |  generated + ERC-checked with KiCad 10 (kicad-cli)" (at 10.16 11.43 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "cb99bf82-9c4c-4384-b4b7-33082af85e95"))
(text "NOT A MANUFACTURABLE DESIGN. No PCB layout. Every value/pin/footprint marked TBD is an unresolved placeholder (see BOM CSV)." (at 10.16 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "fcd189e8-4e6e-4e95-a710-069f2304bf7d"))
(text "J1/J2 pins: github.com/FrameworkComputer/ExpansionBay Electrical/README.md ; J3: MXM 3.1 connector tables (ADLINK MXM-AXe, Advantech SKY-MXM-RTX3000)." (at 10.16 21.59 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "810f1fe9-785f-46f0-9f8f-13ea90bc24f8"))
(text "Lanes go straight through by name: host PEX_TX -> MXM PEX_TX (MXM names are system-relative). Confirm against the MXM spec before ordering." (at 10.16 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "1a716492-7b6b-495b-801a-2c0c2f999571"))
(text "Series parts: host->card PCIe R20-R35 = 0R; card->host PCIe C10-C25 = 220nF; DP_A lanes+AUX C26-C35 = 100nF DC blocking; HPD direct (R14 pull-down DNP)." (at 10.16 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "20391abe-26d8-446b-b89b-f23fb24d0782"))
(text "OPEN: TH_PWM unconnected. J3 = S55B on a 1.2 mm adapter; needs the flat 3D-printed bay cover (15.3 mm inside). Pins 52/53 and the F75303 address per FW16 7040 interface schematic. Checked against MXM 3.1 r1.0." (at 10.16 34.29 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "c4c95974-2c24-41c0-b5e8-eca71d36cc15"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
